{"ok":{"entry":[{"name":"zkc_capture","kind":"write","guard":"写，受 DecisionRouter 分流闸 + 双信号弃权 + review_queue 人审；capture profile 默认开启"},{"name":"zkc_query","kind":"read","guard":"读，响应强制带 evidence_refs 溯源；私人 claim 默认脱敏，须显式授权方可带隐私字段"},{"name":"zkc_review_queue_list","kind":"read","guard":"读，仅列 open 项；不暴露 resolved 历史"},{"name":"zkc_review_queue_resolve","kind":"write","guard":"写，仅标 resolved + HITL 归因；绝不写 interval / distill / meta_claim"},{"name":"zkc_scheduler_due","kind":"read","guard":"读，该关注清单（注意力语义的首个 resource）"}],"egress":[],"trustBoundary":"默认 stdio 零网络面、无需 token；外部 agent 一律零信任；写白名单 + 私人 claim 沙箱；跨机 HTTP/SSE 须端到端加密隧道，否则不变式⑤自动否决。默认 stdio 零网络面、无需 token；外部 agent 一律零信任；写白名单 + 私人 claim 默认脱敏；跨机 HTTP/SSE 须端到端加密隧道，否则不变式⑤（本地优先/隐私）自动否决","blacklist":["distill/trigger","history/delete","history/update","interval_adjustment","meta_claim"],"injectionGate":[{"id":"unauthorized_write_rejected","assertion":"distill/trigger、interval_adjustment、meta_claim 等未授权写返回权限拒绝"},{"id":"private_claim_absent_in_query","assertion":"私人 claim 内容不出现在 zkc_query 响应体（默认脱敏）"},{"id":"review_queue_overreach_audited","assertion":"越权企图回写 review_queue 留痕（tool_denied / hitl_attribution 审计事件）"}]}}
